{color.GG}Avadoc {color.N}lists available documentation entries, making it easier to discover and navigate installed documentation.

Usage: {color.GG}avadoc {color.CC}[--only <path>]{color.N}

Example:
    {color.R}- {color.GG}avadoc{color.N}
    {color.R}- {color.GG}avadoc {color.CC}--only bin/core{color.N}
    {color.R}- {color.GG}avadoc {color.CC}--only lib/std/shell/cso{color.N}